# .dockerignore — keep host-built artifacts and noise out of the Docker
# build context. Critical: bin/ and obj/ from a Windows `dotnet build` carry
# absolute host paths inside obj/project.assets.json, which makes the Linux
# container's `dotnet publish --no-restore` blow up trying to resolve them.

# .NET build outputs (host-specific)
**/bin/
**/obj/

# IDE / editor caches
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Test outputs
**/TestResults/

# Container persistent volumes (if you ever bind-mount these locally)
**/postgres-data/
**/rabbitmq-data/

# VCS — not needed inside the image
.git/
.github/

# Misc
**/*.md
**/UpgradeLog.htm
**/Backup/
